  "releaseNotes": "- Updated LogicMonitor.Api to 3.240.88, which adds the agentic privilege object type and\n\t\t  Role.tenantIdentifier. Neither reaches the mapping profiles, because Role is not a mapped\n\t\t  destination type, so no new Ignore() was required. ValidateAutoMapperProfiles passes\n\t\t  against it.\n\t\t- Restored the VSTest test runner. A governance remediation had moved the repository onto\n\t\t  Microsoft Testing Platform while the test project still targets xunit 2.9.3, which has no\n\t\t  Microsoft Testing Platform entry point, so no test was discoverable. Test infrastructure\n\t\t  only, with no consumer-visible change.\n\t\t- Dependency updates: Microsoft.Data.SqlClient 7.0.3, Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore 10.0.12,\n\t\t  Microsoft.Extensions.Caching.Memory 10.0.12, Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.UserSecrets\n\t\t  10.0.12, PanoramicData.Mapper 10.0.47 and PanoramicData.NCalcExtensions 6.1.39.",
